window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Abby Storm</b><br> <i>The Soul Contract Series</i><br> <b>Love was supposed to be forever. Until it wasn’t.</b><br> <br> Abby Storm had it all — a devoted husband, two beautiful children, and a life built on safety, order, and control. But behind the perfectly manicured lawns and picture-perfect family portraits, something inside her was quietly unraveling. Then came the break-in. Brutal. Shattering. Transformative.<br> <br> What should have destroyed her instead awakens something buried deep — a hunger she can’t explain, a darkness she can’t ignore, and a desire she was never supposed to feel. As her world tilts off its axis, Abby is forced to confront the terrifying truth: the life she built may not be the life she wants.<br> <br> Torn between the comfort of the known and the pull of a dangerously compelling stranger, Abby begins a journey of self-discovery that challenges everything she believed about love, marriage, motherhood — and herself.<br> <b><br> Raw, provocative, and emotionally fearless</b>, <i>Abby Storm</i> is the first book in <i>The Soul Contract Series</i>, exploring the intricate threads of identity, power, and the soul-deep connections that refuse to be tamed.<br> <b><br> Trigger Warning:</b> This book contains graphic scenes, psychological intensity, and content that may be disturbing to some listeners. Intended for mature audiences only.</p>"; 
